                <note rend="inline" type="source">663.116/60: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Austria</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Kliefoth</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-04-21T13:00:00+01:00">April 21, 1934—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received April 21—8:20 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>56. Your telegram No. 22, April 20, 1 p.m. Have taken matter up with Foreign
                    Office this morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kliefoth</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
